  "claim": "Skip Kelly shared a mike with this notable radio personality who was born in North Bend, Oregon in 1950.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Radio personality. Sentence: Notable radio personalities include pop music radio hosts Martin Block, Alan Freed, Dick Clark, Delilah Luke, Ameen Sayani, Wolfman Jack, and Casey Kasem, shock jocks such as Don Imus and Howard Stern, as well as sports talk hosts such as Mike Francesa and political talk hosts such as Rush Limbaugh.\nPage: Delilah (radio host). Sentence: Delilah Rene (born February 15, 1960, North Bend, Oregon) is an American radio personality, author, and songwriter, best known as the host of a nationally syndicated nightly U.S. radio song request and dedication program, with an estimated 8 million listeners.\nPage: Skip Kelly. Sentence: On air, he has shared the same mic as well known personalities Ryan Seacrest, Danny Bonaduce, Delilah, Matt Siegel, and Dale Dorman.",
